#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/advanced-networking/_index.adoc:462
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is also possible to bring up the interface manually using man:"
"wpa_supplicant[8] and man:ifconfig[8]."
